      "content": "i appreciate the help but it feels so clinical. like u are just trying to fix me. it doesnt change the fact that the void feels more real than the ground does. its like the world is a party i wasn't invited to and i'm just standing outside in the dark watching it through a window. wouldnt it be easier to just... stop trying to find a way in and just let the dark take me?",
